<title>USA: New York physical copper market - June 27.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - June 27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for July shipment were quoted at a nominal 115.75 to 116.00 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 92.50 cents per lb, up 0.50 cent from June 26th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
